Subject: [PATCH] logging: snapshot transaction relay and orphan lifecycle
 fields

Convert twelve transaction relay and orphan lifecycle diagnostics with actual TxId, PeerId and eviction Count values. Remove hash formatting from callers while preserving original text, categories, severity and branches. Add structured dictionary checks alongside unchanged human-text assertions in three existing production functional scenarios: force relay, orphan overflow and rejected parents.

